## Limits

<%_   if (limits.requests) { _%>
- <%= limits.requests.capacity %> requests per user and per <%= limits.requests.unit %>.
<%_   } _%>
<%_   if (limits.tokens) { _%>
- <%= limits.tokens.capacity %> model tokens per user and per <%= limits.tokens.unit %>, given back in full at the end of each <%= limits.tokens.unit %>.
<%_   } _%>

